1
00:00:01,520 --> 00:00:05,689
Every great villain
needs a monologue.

2
00:00:05,729 --> 00:00:07,252
Timer's on.

3
00:00:07,322 --> 00:00:12,058
People of Earth!
For too long you have laughed at me...

4
00:00:18,028 --> 00:00:22,999
...and THAT is why
the Earth is mine. The end.

5
00:00:23,069 --> 00:00:25,958
Three hours,
eleven minutes.

6
00:00:25,998 --> 00:00:27,364
Too short?

7
00:00:27,934 --> 00:00:30,110
Your plants died.

8
00:00:30,580 --> 00:00:33,304
Fine.
Short version.

9
00:00:33,674 --> 00:00:35,127
Kneel.

10
00:00:35,167 --> 00:00:36,846
Better.
